abstract: >
  Data analytics project exploring simple and multiple linear regression
  and predictive modeling with Python using the Palmer Penguins dataset.
  The project compares bill depth, bill length, and flipper length as
  individual predictors of body mass before combining all three features
  in a multiple linear regression model. Model performance is evaluated
  using a baseline, RMSE, R-squared, predictions, and residual analysis.


